      "signature": "AddConstraints(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "TSimpleConstraintContainerSolver*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "RBAN API.\nAdd all (active) constraints to the solver."
    },
    {
      "id": "add-constraints-ad59c5",
      "name": "AddConstraints",
      "category": "SolverConstraintContainer",
      "signature": "AddConstraints(Target, Constraints)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "TSimpleConstraintContainerSolver*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Constraints",
          "type": "TArrayView<Private::FPBDIslandConstraint*>&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Island API.\nAdd a set of constraints to the solver. This can be called multiple times: once for each island in an IslandGroup, but\nthere will never be more constraints added than specified in Reset().\nNOTE: this should not do any actual data gathering - it should just add to the list of constraints in this group. All data\ngathering is handled in GatherInput."
    },
    {
      "id": "add-bodies",
